==Battleground==
*5 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns.
**3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 86.67~90 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,700f</sup>.
**8 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

